{title: Preme Pora Baron}
{artist: Lagnajita Chakraborty}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Preme pora baron [Em] karone okaaron,        [C] Angule angul rakhleo [D] hat dhora [G] baron
[G] Preme pora baron [Em] kaaron okaron,        [C] Angule angul rakhleo [D] hat dhora [G] baron
[G] Preme pora baron,        Tomay [Em] joto golpo [D] bolaar [G] chillo
Tomay [Em] joto golpo [D] bolar chilo [G] oh,        Shob [Em] papri hooye [D] gacher pashe
[C] choriye roye [G] chilo?        Daaoni tumi [C] amay se shob
[D] Kuriye neowar [G] kono kaaron,        Preme pora baron [Em] karone okaaron
Oyi [C] maaya chokhe chok rakhleo,        [D] fhire takano [G] baron
[Em] Shune washi [Bm] ratri ekhono [Em] guni,        Tomar amar [D] nouka baowar,
[A] shob do ekhono [G] shuni,        [G] Tayi mukh lukhiye [C] thot fuliye
[D] Boshonter eyi [G] smritichaaron,        Preme pora baron [Em] karone okaron
[C] Mone porleo aaj ke tomaai,        [D] mone kora [G] baron
[G] Preme pora baron
